.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
# Every env file, not just the live one. Environment variables reach the
# container through the compose `env_file:` directive, never through the image,
# so nothing needs an env file baked in — and .env.dev previously was, carrying
# the Auth0 machine-to-machine secret and the session signing secret into every
# image layer.
.env
.env.*
